Waste Ordinance (ADWO)
SR 814.600 — Ordinance of 4 December 2015 on the Avoidance and the Disposal of Waste (Waste Ordinance, ADWO).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2015/891]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
This English text is the consolidation of 1 January 2026. The binding German, French and Italian texts have since been consolidated to 1 August 2026, so this translation is behind current law.

